{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TYyryzKERc1795593617.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《審計報告》指，地政總署處理土地契約修訂時出現長年積壓及延誤，最長一宗個案要近30年。</p><p></p><p>審計署指，地政總署過去十年共903宗土地交易申請，截至3月底，326宗仍在處理，最久三宗由19至29.1年。審計署深入審查最長6宗個案，平均需要23.7年，單是收到申請到核實有效都要12.7年；又指申請人無採取行動，地政總署亦無主動與申請人跟進。</p><p></p><p>建議地政總署監察所有仍處理的申請，及早識別需尋求上級督導的個案。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T08:43:54.019937+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T07:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T11:17:21.670550+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T08:37:17.746012+00:00","content_hash":"e758f3d51d576209f237a54d96355bd6f7eea0236b96c7dbe9e49fd857004fe7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}